Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were consumed by bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shandian warriors, they only\Nattacked God's Island, Upper Yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they wanted to regain a homeland\Nof their ancestors which we took.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, you're not thinking\Nabout that again, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the peaceful existence\Nof the citizens of Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be this way\Nhad our ancestors not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taken control of the\NUpper Yard 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is our duty to carry on this battle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to ensure the peaceful\Nnature of this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've tried to negotiate with them, but if\Nthey cannot abide by these negotiations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they do not deserve your compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,400 years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that it's time for this endless\Nstrife and bloodshed to come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only wish that we could\Nall live in harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:01:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put these needless battles behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it another attack by the Shandians?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a man who calls himself God Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What God Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the courage\Nthat sail and believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.47,0:02:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.46,0:02:13.63,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.46,0:02:13.63,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailed toward different\Ndreams, things had changed now!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.00,0:02:18.92,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.00,0:02:18.92,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For together we found, we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.01,0:02:24.26,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.01,0:02:24.26,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NWestfal\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.23,0:02:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.26,0:02:31.02,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.26,0:02:31.02,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious points our destiny!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.02,0:02:35.02,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.02,0:02:35.02,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't stop all\Nour troubles, forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.04,0:02:50.66,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.04,0:02:50.66,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}PhosCity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.66,0:02:54.71,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.66,0:02:54.71,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Camotoy\NPollychan\NWepon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.26,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.26,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}PamkinPinguin\NFunimation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.32,0:03:18.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.3\c&H434342&\3c&H434342&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(477,0)\t(432,477,\1a&H00&)}Quintet
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.32,0:03:18.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(477,0)}Quintet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay and take\Ncare of these two, Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there's something\Nimportant I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, I won't\Nlet your death be in vain, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sue Sue!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here and cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this house belongs\Nto that pretty lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who plays her harp\Non the beach all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is her house, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name's Conis, and she\Nlives here with her dad, Page.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both seem like really nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even invited me over\Nto have lunch one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that girl and her\Ndad are really bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away, or you'll get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom told me that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said they were helping\Nthe Blue Sea people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it's true, they're trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father said he'd ground me if\Nhe caught me anywhere near them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, I just\Nremembered your father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daddy's a member of the Enforcers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's out on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom says he'll be coming home soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can hardly wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I've never even seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I think it is so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dad is one of the\Ndivine warriors and I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure your dad will come\Nhome to see you real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:05:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skypiea will be dropped\Nback into the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let his death be in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must tell the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to warn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did all these ruins\Nfall out of the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not my day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you fell\Ndown here with all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it almost killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good to see you, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the city of gold\Nwe've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find the treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no evidence\Nthat gold was ever here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was one crazy\Nride if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I want to go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world did you\Nhold on to the Waver's jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else managed to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we've been left behind\Nbecause of your stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.07,0:06:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we make our way down to the back\Nof the snake and escape out its butthole?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Think again, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mr. Weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got lucky when we\Nlanded on these clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.89,0:07:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left Luffy and Aisa behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.93,0:07:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pierre's gone to fetch our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when Push comes to shove, he's\Na very reliable bird or horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where did we end up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be perfectly honest,\NI have no idea where we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it looks like we fell to the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've traveled all across the\Nupper yard in my lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've never seen this place before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really our homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora, in the\Nname of the great warrior Kalgara!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going back to our homeland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found what\NI've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The proud city that my\Nancestors protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the snake is\Nlooking for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that or Luffy's doing\Nsomething that's bothering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That snake sure is acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of\Nthis, Master of the Sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you getting\Nyourself so worked up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've always been an annoyance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My son! Oh, no, Aisa! She's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she could\Nhave survived that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin? And Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you guys get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you get out of the snake's stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you're all right, Navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not so sure about the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy was still in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to get him out\Nbut he fell off the waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that brat is nothing\Nbut a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he aware of how much of a hassle he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.47,0:10:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enaru You destroyed him when my bazooka\Ncouldn't even scratch the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Aokiji, I can only\Nhope she somehow survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no way to treat your host,\Nnow, is it, Wiper the warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that you'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it was I who brought you\Nhere and returned you to your homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want the fun\Nto win so soon, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:11:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a game to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and a truly petty game at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all of you, we'll be competing\Nagainst each other for my entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy so many of\Nyou've made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I extend my welcome to you survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now the fun truly begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a survival game to see\Nhow many people out of an original
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People 81, including myself, are still\Nstanding after three hours on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last person left will,\Nof course, be the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Among you are a few participants\Nwho entered late into the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've decided to allow them to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will make it all the more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the five of us will continue\Non in the final stage of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say five people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.27,0:12:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Robin, Gunfall,\NBazooka Man, and Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing he hasn't\Nnoticed that I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In just a few minutes, the\Nthree hours will be up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that the six people we\Nhave present here are one too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one thing I know is that\NGod's prophecy will never falter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to see how this\Nperson is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you all fight each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you gang up on\None of the weaker ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could all resist your\Nfates and force me to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to kill\Nanyone. I won't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't compete in your sick game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I, too, refuse to take part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you gotta drag me into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one dying today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to threaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit, I'm quite impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you have no idea\Nwhat you're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the four of you together\Ndon't stand a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot comprehend the extent of my\Npowers and what I'm truly capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you, an elderly\Nbuffoon wanting peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a warrior who single-mindedly\Nseeks his homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thieves from the Blue Sea who\Nare only concerned with treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, for one reason or another,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.09,0:14:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek to save this wretched\Nplace called Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you cannot, because this\Nnation is fundamentally flawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to stand here and\Nlisten to such nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me where the divine warriors are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly is your goal here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why an ascension, my old\Nfriend? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, when I ascend, I will\Nreturn to my rightful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that\Nyou're leaving, Skypiea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.33,0:14:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will soon leave this dreadful wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the island where I grew up, there were\Nlegends of a place regarded as God's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:14:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As God's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People call this place Endless Birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.95,0:15:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there, the ground extends as far\Nas the eye can see, in all directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my dream to find\Nthis place, this paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Endless Birth, a home fit for a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My time spent here battling\Nover the inconsequential lands
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Upper Yard has been\Nnothing but a petty triviality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you this place that\Nyou cherish is an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was born in the sky,\Nthough it's not a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It lives in the sky,\Nthough it's not a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This nation which exists in the\Nsky is an utterly unnatural one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we die, we all return\Nto the earth, to the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:15:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here, there is none.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't be\Nsurprised by my intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As God, I'm bound to adhere to\Nthe divine province on nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why this unnatural nation will\Nbe ripped apart and pulled from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're planning on wiping\Nout Skypea completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so conceited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The term god is just the title used\Nto refer to the leader of this nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, but that will soon change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true god does not\Nlive amongst the humans
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like you do and treat\Nthem as his playthings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Former God, Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're worried about the\Ndivine warriors, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your divine warriors lost\Na battle against my forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I took 650 of your\Nsubordinates under my charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They served me well until this morning,\Nwhen I could find no more use for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, did I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The six of us here now are the only\Nones left alive in this forsaken place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I wanted to harm\Nthem, but when I told them my goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they dared to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they paid the price\Nfor that insupportination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were good men, and they all\Nhad families on Angel Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to bury\Ntheir families beside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THE DEVIL!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HILL!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,5 million, 10 million, 20 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel, what should we do with this old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's useless. Can we kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just throw him into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt he can even be\Nused for manual labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This shrine, on the other hand,\Ncould be quite useful to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what we really need are the\Nservices of the divine warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could be put to work in\Nbringing about my ultimate goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.35,0:19:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will never help you in your cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence you're no longer\Nin charge old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 million volts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God does exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How mortifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that God is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Rumble Rumble Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this particular fruit is said to\Nhave the power of invincibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human has no chance against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.21,0:20:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that I have foreseen\Nwill finally come to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The four of you should feel\Nhonored to have survived this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come along,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.23,0:20:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will join me as I gain passage to\Nmy dream world, to the Endless Birth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me, come and\Nfulfill your destinies!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There I will build an\Nindisputable nation of gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where only the Chosen Ones\Nare permitted to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a utopia of boundless and eternal power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.71,0:20:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not let those who are unworthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like those incompetent subordinates of\Nmine, sully the stature of this new nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only those who pass my judgment may\Nbask in the glory of my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what will you do if we refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.09,0:21:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why refuse to join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll fall into a bottomless pit along\Nwith the rest of this unnatural nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt you could destroy the\Nentirety of the Upper Yard in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you decide to destroy all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then won't you also be destroying\Nsomething that you cherish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean the Golden Bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the Golden Bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Golden Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry. No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.43,0:21:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already made arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what I know about\Nyour travels across Sky Pier,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe I know where\Nthe bell is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking, and it\Nwon't be long before I have the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.73,0:21:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think that you, a mere\Nhuman, could ever get the better of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How foolish of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I hate more in this\Nworld than a cold, calculating woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.05,0:22:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.65,0:22:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you are completely out of your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.33,0:23:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he manage to\Nneutralize the bazooka's blast?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.23,0:23:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your energy doesn't even register to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm more powerful than\Nyou could ever comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thunderclap reverberated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that only happens when the\Nair expands at the speed of sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.47,0:23:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.97,0:23:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That amount of power is greater\Nthan anything we can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really is made of lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.11,0:23:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon those who remain will set off\Nfor the endless birth together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.53,0:24:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even understand what\Na rare privilege this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.53,0:24:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why do you assume\Nwe'll come willingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about\Nyour so-called dream world!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.29,0:24:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.20,0:24:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.31,0:24:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.61,0:24:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.25,0:24:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon your body will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.13,0:24:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I possess a tremendous power that you\Npuny humans can never hope to overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.37,0:24:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.07,0:24:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:25:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one loses all hope, it is an\Nexperience not unlike losing one's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.49,0:25:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People fear death above all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.53,0:25:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why people\Nprostrate themselves before
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.29,0:25:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an insurmountable power and beg for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.93,0:25:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is simply the natural order of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.51,0:25:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beings are meant to bow\Nbefore that which they fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.07,0:25:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.31,0:25:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bound by your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how\Nincredibly strong he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.51,0:25:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.87,0:25:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.39,0:25:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the\NSea Prism Stone, Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.97,0:25:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea Prism Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.49,0:25:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a stone that can\Ncounteract Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.57,0:26:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, do your worst, Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.07,0:26:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea Prism Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.29,0:26:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said to harness the power of\Nthe entire ocean into a single blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the sea, condensed into solid form!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.53,0:26:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything can overcome the power\Nof the Devil Fruit, it's the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.41,0:26:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.31,0:26:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're aware of the\Nconsequences, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.31,0:26:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body will pay a heavy price as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.57,0:26:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why sacrifice yourself for a\Nhomeland you will never regain?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.05,0:26:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I must, I'll die. Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.69,0:26:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it means I can take you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.41,0:26:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.75,0:26:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.01,0:26:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold our true ambitions in your\Nheart and speak not of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.89,0:26:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the weavers of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.87,0:27:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the words that were\Nwritten on a poneglyph 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.41,0:27:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poneglyph? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.57,0:27:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when those who sought to steal\Nthe stone revealed themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.73,0:27:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Shandora warriors of the City of\NGold fought bravely to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.11,0:27:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the battle took its toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.43,0:27:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great many warriors died that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.61,0:27:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those few who survived vowed to\Nbecome guardians of the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.75,0:27:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They kept watch over\Nthe city and the sacred
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.11,0:27:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monoglyph they swore\Nto defend to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you say that's the true\Nstory of our ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.11,0:27:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then the island and city of gold\Nwere taken away to Skypiea 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.35,0:27:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then, it's been\Nunder Skypean control.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.43,0:27:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors fought to their\Nlast breath to defend that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.55,0:27:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then it was taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.51,0:27:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.47,0:27:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is our homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.27,0:28:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.55,0:28:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it alone holds a history that has\Ndisappeared into the darkness of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's under the\Ncontrol of the Skypiea now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.47,0:28:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we must never allow the fire of the\Nproud city of Shandora to die out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.61,0:28:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.31,0:28:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.39,0:28:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.30,0:28:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.37,0:28:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.35,0:28:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's restarting his own heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.81,0:29:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that people fear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.05,0:29:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rather, it is God who is fear itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.37,0:29:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is what this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.27,0:29:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, I warned you, did I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.57,0:29:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you of the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.85,0:29:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now look where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.17,0:29:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.29,0:29:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.45,0:29:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't address me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.25,0:29:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if you know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.05,0:30:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.15,0:30:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proud Shandora warriors fought\Nfor the fate of this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.11,0:30:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fought to their death to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.29,0:30:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a descendant of those warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.07,0:30:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day our homeland\Nwas taken away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.37,0:30:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For four hundred years, we've carried\Nthe great warrior Kalkurus injured pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.79,0:30:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've sought to return our homeland\Nto its rightful place for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.47,0:30:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that I've finally made it...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.79,0:30:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're standing...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.39,0:30:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.53,0:30:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my... way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.55,0:30:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit you landed a good blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.07,0:30:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what a cheap trick,\Nusing that sea stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.75,0:30:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and on top of that using\Na reject dial should
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.59,0:31:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easily kill the ordinary\Nuser but you shot it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.65,0:31:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,twice and you're still\Nbreathing quite impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However you're still no match for me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.89,0:31:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.23,0:31:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 million volts!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.57,0:31:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this has a sea prism stone in it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.61,0:31:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's your turn,\Nswordsmen of the blue sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.53,0:31:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only choice now is\Nto kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.81,0:32:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keaton!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.81,0:32:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.23,0:32:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.69,0:32:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone has fallen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.91,0:32:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.89,0:32:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.29,0:33:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as hurt as he is, he\Nstill intends to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.89,0:33:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you hope to prove?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.29,0:33:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to die anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.07,0:33:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not make it easy on yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.53,0:33:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say it's been 400 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.27,0:33:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.73,0:33:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and the Shandians have been\Nfighting to take back your homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.07,0:33:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, you are the only warrior\Nwho has managed to make it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.71,0:33:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder this nation will soon fall to\Nthe Blue Sea and be lost for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.51,0:33:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fighting for a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.59,0:33:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that you'll\Nnever regain your homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.63,0:33:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.95,0:33:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why get back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.65,0:33:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.25,0:33:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must confess I was\Nhoping for a better answer
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.95,0:34:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than that but then again\NI doubt you're even!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.69,0:34:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Completely conscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.71,0:34:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.67,0:34:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.59,0:34:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.05,0:34:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.99,0:34:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you are a descendant of\Nthe great warrior Kal 'gara,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.57,0:34:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel I must impart this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.79,0:34:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not many know the real reason\NKal 'gara wanted to regain the
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.91,0:34:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,homeland and why he would stop\Nat nothing to do so. So tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.41,0:34:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's the real reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.25,0:34:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.29,0:34:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kal 'gara felt that the\Nloss of his homeland
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.23,0:34:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was his greatest failure The problem was,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he lost something else\Nimportant to him El Thor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.55,0:35:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all who stood before me,\Nyou are the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.45,0:35:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.36,0:35:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.69,0:35:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.87,0:35:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go with you.
